n/latest/organization/pull_requests/creating_pull_requests.html#the-interactive-rebase) for more information\r\n\r\nI've done that, but I wish I understood why the maintainers of this project forbid \"squash and merge\". ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3444063646/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3444064874","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109844#issuecomment-3444064874","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109844","id":3444064874,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NSEJq","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-24T16:50:11Z","updated_at":"2025-10-24T16:50:11Z","body":"Is the title of the PR outdated? The code doesn't filter out only in editor builds now","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3444064874/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3444067521","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109844#issuecomment-3444067521","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109844","id":3444067521,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NSEzB","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-24T16:51:18Z","updated_at":"2025-10-24T17:03:01Z","body":"> I've done that, but I wish I understood why the maintainers of this project forbid \"squash and merge\".\r\n\r\nFor several reasons, one is the workload on our production team (dozens of PRs is a *lot* to squash and make sure it was done right, considering squashing a single one can be annoying, imagine a dozen), another is that we want a clean history where we have a clear merge commit which means the PR is as is, without other changes, so it can be easily reverted, or cherry picked\r\n\r\nWe could use \"squash and use merge commit\" but GitHub doesn't allow that, we also have several maintainers and contributors who sign their commits because downstream consumers need that security, if we *only* used one type of merge method we'd lose that (squashed commits, or plain merged commits lose their sign information as it is recommitted), and having multiple means of merging things doesn't work with merge queues, and adds a burden to the production team","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3444067521/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3444073937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109844#issuecomment-3444073937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109844","id":3444073937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NSGXR","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","receiv